{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "Run this command in your computer's terminal. It installs Meow, asks for your Device Key and connects the agents it finds. No Go or GitHub account is needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在电脑终端运行这条命令，即可安装 Meow、输入 Device Key 并接入检测到的 Agent。无需安装 Go 或登录 GitHub。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew and other installation options": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 与其他安装方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Install and connect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 安装并接入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy install and setup command": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制安装与接入命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CLI already installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已经安装 CLI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download a ready-to-run CLI. No Go or GitHub account is needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直接下载可运行的 CLI，无需安装 Go 或登录 GitHub。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS · Homebrew": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS · Homebrew"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy install command": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制安装命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS / Linux · Direct install": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS / Linux · 直接安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Direct installation saves Meow in ~/.local/bin and checks its SHA-256 checksum. It starts setup for this server immediately; paste your Device Key when asked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直接安装会将 Meow 保存到 ~/.local/bin 并校验 SHA-256，随后立即接入当前服务器。看到提示后粘贴 Device Key 即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After Homebrew, or if already installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 安装后，或已安装 CLI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloads and installation guide": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载与安装说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Setup sends a test notification to this iPhone. Your Device Key is entered separately and is not included in the copied setup command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接入完成后会向这台 iPhone 发送测试通知。Device Key 单独输入，不会包含在复制的接入命令中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CLI installation help": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CLI 安装帮助"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ doesn't look like a Meow server. Check the address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 看起来不是 Meow 服务器，请检查地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Run this command": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 运行这条命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Paste your Device Key when asked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 出现提示时粘贴 Device Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advanced": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高级"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents and scripts use your Device Key to send to this iPhone. The key can only send, never read or answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent 和脚本用你的 Device Key 给这台 iPhone 发通知。这个密钥只能发送，不能读取或回答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents use the Device Key to send to this iPhone. It can only send, never read or answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent 用 Device Key 给这台 iPhone 发通知。它只能发送，不能读取或回答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All caught up": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "都看完了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
