      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "筛选通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gateway": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网关"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get started": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High-priority messages and questions use Time Sensitive Notifications. Enable them in Meow's notification settings and in Settings → Focus → your Focus → Apps. Silent mode still silences their sound.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高优先级消息和问题使用时效性通知。请在 Meow 的通知设置，以及「设置 → 专注模式 → 对应模式 → App」中允许时效性通知。静音模式下仍不会响铃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In a terminal on your computer, run the command below. It checks the server, asks for your Device Key and connects Claude Code and Codex.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在电脑的终端里运行下面的命令。它会检查服务器、询问你的 Device Key，并连接 Claude Code 和 Codex。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inbox": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收件箱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inbox sync": {
