            "value": "这个回答不在可选项中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TLS certificate of %@ isn't trusted. Use a certificate from a public CA.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的 TLS 证书不受信任，请使用公共 CA 签发的证书。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address of your Meow server. You can change it later in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Meow 服务器地址，之后可以在设置中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current key stops working right away. Agents and scripts that use it need the new key.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前密钥会立即失效，使用它的 Agent 和脚本需要换成新密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current key will stop working. Update your agents with the new key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前密钥将失效，请为 Agent 更新为新密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new key works, but the old key could not be revoked: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新密钥已生效，但旧密钥没能吊销：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The notification sound is unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知提示音暂时无法使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server address is different from your Device Key. Meow creates that key after you connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器地址不是 Device Key。连接后，Meow 会为你创建设备密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server has changed.": {},
    "The server is changing. Please try again afterward.": {},
    "These answers were refused by the server and won't be sent again. You can copy an answer or delete its saved record.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些回复已被服务器拒绝，不会再次发送。你可以复制回复，或删除本机保存的记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This checks the server, not your computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这只能检查服务器，不能检查你的电脑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone is no longer registered with the server. Change or reset the server in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 已不在服务器上注册。请在设置中更换或重置服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone is no longer registered with the server. In Settings, choose Re-register this server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 iPhone 的服务器凭据已失效。请在设置中选择“重新注册此服务器”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone will be registered on the new server with a new Device Key. Your agents will need the new key.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 会在新服务器上重新注册，并获得新的 Device Key。你的 Agent 需要换成新密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This question expired before your answer arrived.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的回答送达前，这个问题已经过期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This question is no longer waiting for an answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个问题已不再等待回答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This question no longer exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个问题已不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This question was already answered: “%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个问题已经回答过了：“%@”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This saved reply was discarded when changing servers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这条已保存的回复在切换服务器时被放弃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time Sensitive Notifications": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "时效性通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on notifications": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn them on in Settings so Meow can alert you. Without them, messages still arrive in the inbox.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在设置中打开通知，以便 Meow 提醒你。不打开的话，消息仍会出现在收件箱里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unavailable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unread": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未读"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use an https:// address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请使用 https:// 地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the address from the person running your Meow server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Meow 服务器维护者提供的地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the hosted Meow server": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Meow 官方服务器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify installation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View all pending questions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看全部待回答问题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "待回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for a test notification from your computer…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待来自电脑的测试通知…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for your answer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "待回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting to send": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待发送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the version appears, return to setup and run the connection command. Keep your Device Key ready to paste when asked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "看到版本号后，返回配置页面运行连接命令，并在提示时粘贴 Device Key。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where do I get a server address?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如何获取服务器地址？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You answered": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have replies waiting to send. Keep waiting, or discard them to change servers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有回复等待发送。你可以继续等待，或放弃这些回复后切换服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll register again on this server with a new Device Key. Update your agents to use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将在此服务器重新注册并生成新的 Device Key，请更新 Agent 使用的密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll register on the new server with a new Device Key. Update your agents to use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将在新服务器重新注册并获取新的 Device Key。请为 Agent 更新为新密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你目前处于离线状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've read everything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有通知都已读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agents are calling.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Agent 在呼叫你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agents can reach you now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在你的 Agent 可以找到你了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your answer is saved and will be sent when the connection is back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的回答已保存，网络恢复后会自动发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your answer wasn't accepted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的回答没有被接受"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "meow setup sends one when it finishes. You can also run meow \"Hello\" in your terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "meow setup 完成时会发送一条。你也可以在终端运行 meow \"Hello\"。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刚刚"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
